    "detailed_description": "In Glutenberg you are one of those previleged who have access to the Glue10 technologie, it allows you to combine different parts the way you want to create functionning - or not - vehicules, to complete simple missions and may be pass the Glutenberg Eng. Program\u2122 and get regonized for your real value.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><br>- Buy parts of different shapes and features.<br>- Build vehicules by assembling parts in real time with maximal freedom.<br>- Drive your rolling or flying or floating creations.<br>- Complete challenges and timed trading deliveries to earn credits.<br>- Explore Glutenberg island.<br>- Creative mode to try ideas and designs.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes:</h2><br>- <strong>Normal:</strong> Earn credits buy completing challenges and timed trading deliveries, buy parts to build your vehicules.<br>- <strong>Creative:</strong> Build your vehicules for free, all parts are available to make your dream vehicule at no cost.",
